section(class='main-banner')
	div(class='main-container main-banner__shell')
		div(class='container main-banner__container')
			div(class='main-banner__stage')
				div(class='main-banner__media')
					img(class='main-banner__image' src='./assets/img4.jpg' alt='' width='1600' height='900' loading='eager')
					div(class='main-banner__gradient' aria-hidden='true')

				div(class='main-banner__inner')
					div(class='main-banner__copy')
						h1(class='main-banner__title')
							span(class='main-banner__title-line') Guías para
							span(class='main-banner__title-line main-banner__title-line--accent') sentirte mejor
							span(class='main-banner__title-line') todos los días.
						p(class='main-banner__text') Ideas simples, información útil y recomendaciones para sumar bienestar a tu rutina.

					article(class='main-banner__card')
						a(class='main-banner__card-media' href='#')
							img(class='main-banner__card-image' src='./assets/img1.jpg' alt='' width='220' height='160' loading='lazy')
						div(class='main-banner__card-body')
							p(class='main-banner__card-label') Guía destacada
							h2(class='main-banner__card-title')
								a(class='main-banner__card-title-link' href='#') ¿Cómo elegir tu Recupé Plus según tu rutina?
							p(class='main-banner__card-text') Descubrí cómo cada fórmula puede acompañar tus momentos del día.
							a(class='main-banner__card-link' href='#')
								span Leer guía
								span(class='main-banner__card-arrow' aria-hidden='true') →
